{"text": " Arda'n\u0131n reale maliyeti 2032'ye kadar y\u0131ll\u0131k 9 milyon euro. Ne para de\u011fil mi? Bakal\u0131m \u00f6yle miymi\u015f. Kamavinga 12.5 milyon euro, Valverde 16.7 milyon euro, Rodrigo da 16.7 milyon euro, Bernardo Silva 20.8 milyon euro, Ferland Mendy 10.5 milyon euro al\u0131yor. Yani d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn kimler neler al\u0131yor. Zirvede Mbappe var y\u0131lda 31.3 milyon. Arda 2032'ye kadar 6 sezonda toplam 54 milyon euro kazanacak. Mbappe bu paray\u0131 2 y\u0131l dolmadan kazan\u0131yor. Peki Arda bu s\u00f6zle\u015fmeyi neden imzalad\u0131? \u0130spanyol bas\u0131n\u0131na g\u00f6re Paris Saint-Germain zaten kap\u0131dayd\u0131. Ama Arda reddetti. \u00c7\u00fcnk\u00fc onun i\u00e7in mesele para de\u011fil, bu sezon kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131 o yer o mevki. Zaten onu da kimsenin b\u0131rakmaya niyeti yok. Madrid y\u00f6netimi 800 milyon euroluk bir serbest kalma bedeli ekledi. Sence Arda do\u011fru mu yapt\u0131 yorumlara yaz.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.28, "text": " Arda'n\u0131n reale maliyeti 2032'ye kadar y\u0131ll\u0131k 9 milyon euro.", "tokens": [50364, 1587, 2675, 6, 33484, 957, 68, 2806, 4727, 24566, 945, 11440, 6, 1200, 10456, 288, 37652, 4157, 1722, 38728, 266, 14206, 13, 50580], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.25518813729286194, "compression_ratio": 1.5044247787610618, "no_speech_prob": 0.4916474223136902, "words": [{"word": " Arda", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.68, "probability": 0.5258952155709267}, {"word": "'n\u0131n", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.92, "probability": 0.8949384689331055}, {"word": " reale", "start": 0.92, "end": 1.4, "probability": 0.8759717643260956}, {"word": " maliyeti", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.86, "probability": 0.8687689105669657}, {"word": " 2032", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.52, "probability": 0.9490290880203247}, {"word": "'ye", "start": 2.52, "end": 2.68, "probability": 0.9107467532157898}, {"word": " kadar", "start": 2.68, "end": 3.0, "probability": 0.9773691296577454}, {